    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fear and Hope</i>\u00a0has a decision-based narrative gameplay engine that offers the player multiple branching story paths through the game, each with its own unique challenges, puzzles, clues, characters, and discoveries to explore. Trying to solve all paths provides a good level of replayability allowing players to uncover more of the game's rich lore, world history, and mysteries with each playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging mini-game <strong>3D</strong>\u00a0<strong>puzzles</strong>\u00a0integrated throughout the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/5cabcf8910fc6b31d8372ab4ee7c0762.poster.avif?t=1755432496\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/5cabcf8910fc6b31d8372ab4ee7c0762.webm?t=1755432496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/5cabcf8910fc6b31d8372ab4ee7c0762.mp4?t=1755432496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and inspect\u00a0<strong>clues</strong>\u00a0that change depending on the choices you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/94e7aab638a2153dd0208b2b2cbe4a5b.poster.avif?t=1755432496\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/94e7aab638a2153dd0208b2b2cbe4a5b.webm?t=1755432496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/94e7aab638a2153dd0208b2b2cbe4a5b.mp4?t=1755432496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Games of chance</strong>\u00a0where fortune plays its hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/a025d915ef5d82ade7b4a166d52afed1.poster.avif?t=1755432496\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/a025d915ef5d82ade7b4a166d52afed1.webm?t=1755432496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/a025d915ef5d82ade7b4a166d52afed1.mp4?t=1755432496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intriguing <strong>character conversations,\u00a0</strong>interactions and insights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/083ed52a793e9fadc08da80032153eb3.poster.avif?t=1755432496\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/083ed52a793e9fadc08da80032153eb3.webm?t=1755432496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/083ed52a793e9fadc08da80032153eb3.mp4?t=1755432496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full game (not yet in the demo) will also include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choice and chance based combat situations\u00a0</strong>against various enemies and monsters using a variety of weapons. You may find weapons as hidden clues or obtain them through other means.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survivalist gameplay mechanics</strong> like needing to manage, scavenge and find scarce food and fresh water resources.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39\ud83d\udd39\ud83d\udd39</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;As the same chain fastens the prisoner and the soldier who guards them, so fear and hope, dissimilar as they are, keep step together.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Each belongs to a mind that is in suspense, a mind looking forward to the future. Our memory recalls the tortures of fear, while foresight anticipates them.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The present alone makes no person wretched.&quot;</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Seneca, Letter V</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39\ud83d\udd39\ud83d\udd39</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Let The Adventure Begin</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awake on a path in a strange forest with no idea how you got there or why you are there. There is nothing in your possession outside of the clothes on your back. Shaking off a thick drowsiness and as your mind clears you become determined to find an explanation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a strange, new world where things may not be quite what they seem. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What truths will you uncover, which paths will you follow and where will they take you? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What will your story be?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fear and Hope</i>\u00a0has a decision-based narrative gameplay engine that offers the player multiple branching story paths through the game, each with its own unique challenges, puzzles, clues, characters, and discoveries to explore. Trying to solve all paths provides a good level of replayability allowing players to uncover more of the game's rich lore, world history, and mysteries with each playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging mini-game <strong>3D</strong>\u00a0<strong>puzzles</strong>\u00a0integrated throughout the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/5cabcf8910fc6b31d8372ab4ee7c0762.poster.avif?t=1755432496\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/5cabcf8910fc6b31d8372ab4ee7c0762.webm?t=1755432496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/5cabcf8910fc6b31d8372ab4ee7c0762.mp4?t=1755432496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and inspect\u00a0<strong>clues</strong>\u00a0that change depending on the choices you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/94e7aab638a2153dd0208b2b2cbe4a5b.poster.avif?t=1755432496\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2835240/extras/94e7aab638a2153dd0208b2b2cbe4a5b.webm?t=1755432496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_