us enemies and monsters using a variety of weapons. You may find weapons as hidden clues or obtain them through other means.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survivalist gameplay mechanics</strong> like needing to manage, scavenge and find scarce food and fresh water resources.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39\ud83d\udd39\ud83d\udd39</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;As the same chain fastens the prisoner and the soldier who guards them, so fear and hope, dissimilar as they are, keep step together.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Each belongs to a mind that is in suspense, a mind looking forward to the future. Our memory recalls the tortures of fear, while foresight anticipates them.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The present alone makes no person wretched.&quot;</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Seneca, Letter V</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39\ud83d\udd39\ud83d\udd39</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Let The Adventure Begin</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awake on a path in a strange forest with no idea how you got there or why you are there. There is nothing in your possession outside of the clothes on your back. Shaking off a thick drowsiness and as your mind clears you become determined to find an explanation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a strange, new world where things may not be quite what they seem. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What truths will you uncover, which paths will you follow and where will they take you? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What will your story be?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
